  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "If \\[ \\begin{aligned} &(\\log_3x)(\\log_x2x)(\\log_{2x}y)\\\\ &\\qquad=\\log_xx^2, \\end{aligned} \\] then \\(y\\) equals:",
